<Layout title="DES4800 - Cloudflare Workers + R2">
  <h1>Welcome to DES4800 Physical Product Design</h1>
  
  <p>
    This course is all about bringing your physical product design ideas to life. You’ll learn the essentials of 2D and 3D modeling using professional CAD software while spending plenty of time in the shop working with 3D printers, laser cutters, and hand tools. You’ll cut, measure, glue, and build as you experiment with materials and techniques, using tools like X-Acto knives and T-squares to turn your digital sketches into real objects. Through a series of creative projects, you’ll gain confidence moving between digital design and physical making, developing both precision and imagination in your work.
  </p>
  
  <div class="card">
    <h2>Course Sections</h2>
    <p>Explore tutorials, techniques, and resources for your product design journey.</p>
    <a href="/plasticity/" class="btn">
      Plasticity 3D Modeling →
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Infrastructure</h2>
    <div class="badge-container">
      <span class="badge primary">Cloudflare Workers</span>
      <span class="badge">R2 Object Storage</span>
      <span class="badge">Edge Computing</span>
      <span class="badge">Astro SSR</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  
</Layout>

